      <description>tonsils.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112522072">feamanadh</headword>
      <description>excessive kindness. “Bha e an sud a sior fheamanadh a mach airgiod do dhaoine eile.”</description>
    </item>
    <item>
