    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112430632">mapaid</headword>
      <description>a home-made mop made of wool and a bit of wood. Also in the sense of sticky hair – “Do ghruag na mapaid.”</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112452592">cairt shleamhna</headword>
