    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112465768">cùil chumhaig</headword>
      <description>hemmed in.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112498024">geobadaich</headword>
      <description>at a loss for words. Not speechless as such. Not finding sufficient words which are required.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112513864">pliùsgach</headword>
      <description>lifeless. “Cho pliùsgach ’s tha i coimhead.”</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112519696">iollagan</headword>
