    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112426240">sgreabach</headword>
      <description>affected sheep prior to the era of dipping. Skin came out in red blotches all over.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp112479664">gille mìseadh</headword>
      <description>a mischievous young scamp. In our modern times this word would probably be used of a ‘toy boy’.</description>
    </item>
